WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.610 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
조각 매체의 반대편으로

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.790 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
어떻게 보면 평면이거나 혹은 설치거나

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.050 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
이런 식이었던 구도를

4
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.830 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
생각했던 적도 있었던 것 같은데

5
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.370 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
지금은 오히려 베니스 작업을 하면서는

6
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.450 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
언어와 내러티브

7
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.210 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그리고 언어적이지 않은 것

8
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.970 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
혹은 매체성을 중요하게 생각하는

9
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.290 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
조각 같은 경우는

10
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.340 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
저는 그런 편의 작업을 하지만

11
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.730 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그 작업 자체가 중요한 작업과

12
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:33.290 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
어떠한 이야기를 하기 위해서

13
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.210 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
매개가 되는 작업

14
00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.850 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
이런 구도로 보는 것 같기도 해요.

15
00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.690 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
왜냐하면 비엔날레는 특히 가면

16
00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.570 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
정치·사회적인 이슈가 너무나 많기 때문에

17
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.750 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그 안에서 조각의 언어가

18
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.450 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
어떻게 존재할 수 있는지

19
00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.350 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
이런 구도를 더 많이

20
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.650 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
보게 되는 것 같아요.
